0", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "5": {"title": "Deferred Matters/Additional Business", "number": "5", "content": [], "items": {"1": {"title": "(ADDED) Deferral of Incentive Loan Repayments and Forgiving Interest-Free Loan to London Community Players - Councillor J. Helmer", "number": "1", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by J. Helmer", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by M. van Holst", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That the following actions be taken with respect to the deferral of incentive loan repayments and forgiving interest-free loan to the London Community Players:\n\n\n\na)\u00a0 the Civic Administration BE AUTHORIZED to further extend the deferral period, on Community Improvement Plan loan repayments, on an interest-free basis for a further period of 180 days, being October 2021 to March 2022, where the applicant has requested a further deferral in writing; it being noted that the April 2022 loan repayments will be cashed as planned; and,\n\n\n\nb)\u00a0 the Civic Administration BE AUTHORIZED to forgive the remaining balance of the interest-free loan to the London Community Players, in the amount of $78,749.83.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [{"string": "Voting Record:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by S. Lewis", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by S. Lehman", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That part b) BE REFERRED to the multi-year budget process for consideration; it being noted that part b) reads as follows:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "b)\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0the Civic Administration BE AUTHORIZED to forgive the remaining balance of the interest-free loan to the London 